  text: "Introducing Shaders: a creative tools for anyone making things on the web.\n\
    \n14 interactive experiments to explore: \n- make pixel heat map graphs\n- turn\
    \ words into particles\n- bend images through glass\n- or give an artwork a different\
    \ texture\n\nTune the effects live and use your own images, videos, or SVGs where\
    \ supported. \n\nMake something for a portfolio, a brand campaign, an identity,\
    \ or an idea that doesn’t fit a category yet.\n\nOpen source, with shadcn installation\
    \ and editable code when you’re ready to build."
