- id: '2097155985756598402'
  text: "Rendering 90,000 interactive particles in the browser used to melt GPUs.\
    \ Now, it is the standard for high-end web design. ✨\n\nHere is how to engineer\
    \ a premium, real-time WebGL rendering layer that morphs seamlessly and reacts\
    \ instantly to scroll and mouse movement.\n\nI used Claude Code to build this\
    \ fluid scrollytelling architecture from scratch. Zero heavy video files, zero\
    \ bloated libraries.\n\nThe exact frontend tech stack: \n✅ React & Next.js (Core\
    \ component architecture) \n✅ Three.js / WebGL (Single draw call rendering) \n\
    ✅ Custom GLSL Shaders (Particle physics & geometry morphing) \n✅ Tailwind CSS\
    \ (Pixel-perfect typography overlay)\n\nStop relying on static templates and heavy\
    \ MP4 backgrounds. Start building immersive frontend UI/UX experiences that perform\
    \ flawlessly.\n\nCopy my exact AI build prompt below \U0001F9F5\U0001F447"
