    \ this frontend UI/UX architecture from scratch. Zero manual CSS fighting.\n\n\
    The exact frontend tech stack: \n✅ React & Next.js (Core framework) \n✅ Three.js\
    \ / WebGL (3D creature rendering & environment depth) \n✅ Tailwind CSS (Clean\
    \ typography & modern layout) \n✅ Framer Motion (Custom cursor physics & scroll\
